# ==========================================
# FieldTwin — Environment Configuration
# ==========================================

# FieldTwin uses open-source tools by default.
# No API keys or credentials are required
# for the initial scientific workflow.

# Optional integrations (future phases):
# ArcGIS Online / Esri — only if access is confirmed.
# External map services — only if required.

# Never store passwords, tokens, or private keys here.
# Put actual credentials in a local .env file.
# The .env file must never be committed to Git.